    // the user spends ~1-3s reading the list. Speculatively warm the server's
    // per-window /terminal-frame visual cache for the listed sessions during that
    // window so a subsequent switch is a warm-cache hit (~0.02s) instead of a cold
    // first-frame build (~4s). Bounded (cap listed windows), throttled (coalesce
    // repeated dialog refreshes), and deduped (per-window TTL) so it never floods
    // the control server or the switch's own hot lanes.
    private static final int CAPTURE_RENDERER_FRAME_PREWARM_MAX_WINDOWS = 6;
